Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:05.85,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,Let's become treasure hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:11.11,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,We'll visit treasure vaults around the \Nworld and attain riches and glory!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:12.84,Flashback,Liz,0,0,0,,That sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:14.15,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.49,0:00:16.44,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,M-Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:17.32,Flashback,Ansem,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:18.45,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,If it's us...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.74,0:00:20.97,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,If it's the six of us,\Nwe can definitely do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:23.91,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,And we'll have one goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:26.24,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,To be the best heroes in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:32.15,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,So someday, let's all go to \Nthe imperial capital, Zebrudia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:34.48,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,Right, Krai?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.86,0:00:42.62,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Treasure hunters are considered \Nstars in the imperial capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.40,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,They travel around the world to various \Nruins, the so-called "treasure vaults,"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:50.00,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,and collect the relics hidden inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.03,0:00:56.02,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,It's a job where you risk your life \Nfighting monsters called "phantoms,"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:58.72,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but in return you can attain \Nvast riches and glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.53,0:01:06.78,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,The clan "First Steps" is regarded \Nas very capable in the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:12.62,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,and today, they are holding interviews \Nfor potential new members at a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:15.72,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,A clan is a collection of parties
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:17.86,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,that come together to assist one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.30,0:01:21.33,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,There's a limit to how far \Na solo hunter can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:23.71,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,If you wish to set your sights high,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.71,0:01:28.08,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,it's vital to get into a good party and\Nbecome stronger alongside your comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:32.71,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I failed to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.71,0:01:35.25,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Hey, are you here to join a party as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:38.45,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Sorry to ask out of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:42.38,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Everyone's so on edge that\Nit's been putting me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.69,0:01:44.99,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,But you looked more approachable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.50,0:01:50.52,Top,Rhuda,0,0,0,,My name is Rhuda Runebeck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:53.71,Sign,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(524,1)\an3\bord2\pos(582.889,276.889)\u1}Rhuda Runebeck\N{\fs15\u0}Hunter level 3
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.52,0:01:53.70,Top,Rhuda,0,0,0,,I just recently got promoted to level 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.70,0:01:54.75,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:02:00.01,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,My name is Krai Andrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:01.78,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you, Rhuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:07.85,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,A lot of people showed up, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:11.72,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,I've been going solo until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:15.47,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,but I couldn't handle this treasure vault\N called the "The White Wolf's Den."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:19.28,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,That's why I was thinking \NI could join some sort of part—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:21.36,Top,Greg,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh, girlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:23.30,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Who asked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:26.05,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,You tried to take on the White\NWolf's Den at level 3?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:30.37,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,This isn't a place for \Namateur hunters like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:33.87,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Wha? Who are you calling an amateur?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.23,0:02:37.37,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Steps is a renowned clan,\N even in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:40.30,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,A level 3 may be considered \Nmid-grade anywhere else,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:42.75,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,but here you're essentially a beginner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:46.16,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,You'd better go home \Nbefore you get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.16,0:02:48.51,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,It said that they don't \Ncare what level you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:51.01,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,That's obviously just a formality!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.01,0:02:53.52,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,What? You wanna go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:55.95,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,What exactly did you have in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:57.86,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.31,0:03:03.47,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.47,0:03:04.99,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Take this any further,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.99,0:03:07.44,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,and you'll lose any chance\N of joining our clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:11.58,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:14.23,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Hunters don't draw their \Nblades in the streets!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.23,0:03:16.30,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,That's what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.30,0:03:17.37,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,I slipped...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:20.82,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.82,0:03:23.22,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Are these {\i1}all{\i0} hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:25.66,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:27.85,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,It's so overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:30.25,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,I've never been to a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:31.49,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.49,0:03:33.53,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,This is my fifth time, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.53,0:03:34.69,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,That many?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.27,0:03:37.98,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:39.75,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You don't have to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:42.24,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,For hunters, skill is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:46.21,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Those with talent can instantly make \Na name for themselves and climb the ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:49.87,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Those without cling to the \Nfew chances they get.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:51.75,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Hey, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:54.70,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Which party is that flashy one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:56.65,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,That's quite the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:04:00.93,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, those are the members of Ark Brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:05.18,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Of the ones recruiting, \Nthey're the strongest party.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:05.43,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,1)\fs30\bord2\shad4\blur4\fnTimes New Roman\4c&H00FFFF&\4a&H79&}Ark Brave
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:09.57,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,They managed to complete a level 7 \Ntreasure vault with just six members.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.57,0:04:11.77,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So they're the elite of the elite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:13.54,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,A level 7?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:17.77,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,By the way, the person sitting \Nis their leader, Ark Rodin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.90,0:04:23.40,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,500)\bord2\fs15\pos(140.222,209.334)}"Argent Thunderclap"\N{\u1\fs20}Ark Rodin{\fs15\u0}\NHunter level 7
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:19.55,Top,Kuai,0,0,0,,If he accepts you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:22.64,Top,Kuai,0,0,0,,your success as a hunter is \Nessentially guaranteed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:28.01,Top,Kuai,0,0,0,,but as far as I know, they have never accepted\Na new member through one of these events.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:29.42,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:32.82,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,So what about that desk \Nall the way in the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:34.16,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Nobody's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.39,0:04:36.74,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:39.39,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,You really are clueless, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:41.17,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,What are...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:43.16,Top,Rhuda,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.63,0:04:46.93,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(527,1)\an3\bord2\pos(582.889,276.889)\u1}Greg Zangief\N{\fs15\u0}Hunter level 4
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.16,0:04:46.94,Top,Greg,0,0,0,,Looks like I, the great Greg, \Nhave no choice but to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.35,0:04:48.58,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:51.94,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,That's the table of the party that\Noriginally founded First Steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.55,0:04:51.94,Top,Rhuda,0,0,0,,He doesn't listen, does he...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:53.93,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,That is, the Grievers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:55.72,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,The founders of this clan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:57.11,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,The Grievers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.11,0:05:01.95,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That's the alias of a party of youngsters \Nthat came to this capital a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:04.82,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,With their overabundant and dazzling talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:08.45,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,they made a name for themselves as one \Nof the top parties in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:12.45,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Their full name is "Grieving Souls."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:12.45,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,1)\fs25\bord2\blur4\shad3\4c&HC91499&\3c&H5313BD&\fnGeorgia\c&H000000&}Grieving Souls
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.15,0:05:15.96,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That's the party of my childhood friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:18.47,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,There's a rumor that for \Nthe first time in years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:21.23,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,the Grievers are accepting new members.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.23,0:05:24.85,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,That's the reason behind this huge turnout.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:27.35,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,But look, that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:28.79,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:30.59,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Looks like solo hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:36.64,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,They're also aiming to join\N the best—the Grievers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.03,0:05:38.77,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,There's nobody there, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.77,0:05:40.61,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Those rumors may have \Nbeen a bunch of hot air.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.49,0:05:42.22,Top,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Hey! Where're the Grievers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:44.31,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,I don't have time for losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.31,0:05:48.75,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,I came all the way here because \NI heard the best would show up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:52.00,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,I'll be one of the strongest \Nhunters one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:53.99,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,I've already made it to level 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.99,0:05:59.25,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,And here I was, thinking of allowing the \Ncapital's strongest party to recruit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:01.54,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Look at him talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:04.46,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,No way... He's a higher level than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.07,0:06:07.50,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.31,0:06:10.07,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,You should know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:10.64,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:11.64,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Stop, Tino.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:13.31,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Don't make a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:14.65,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,It'll be over in one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.65,0:06:15.85,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'll beat him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:18.64,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,If my sister were here, \Nthat's what she'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:22.15,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'm the one who deserves \Nto be in Grieving Souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.15,0:06:24.14,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,I told you to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:27.55,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,The vice master told you\Nnot to make a scene, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.55,0:06:29.41,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Just ignore the idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:31.24,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you calling an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:33.03,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,You, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:35.79,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,I'm already busy, so don't \Nmake more work for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:38.04,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:42.05,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Show him what the Steps are made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:43.16,Default,Hunters,0,0,0,,All right, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.16,0:06:45.32,Default,Hunters,0,0,0,,Show her what you've got, ya dumb kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:45.83,Top,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Who you calling dumb?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.83,0:06:46.79,Default,Hunters,0,0,0,,Get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.83,0:06:51.89,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:06:58.91,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Let's go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:00.53,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,We're dead if we get mixed up in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:02.06,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.51,0:07:03.32,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.31,0:07:07.52,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Bring it on, then, shorty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:09.61,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,I can't go easy on you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.61,0:07:10.82,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:13.60,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'll figure out everything\Nelse after I've killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:15.83,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Just like my sister taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.15,0:07:18.52,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I knew I shouldn't have come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:20.99,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,You all ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:22.72,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.72,0:07:25.03,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Give it all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:29.48,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Ready... Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.09,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:44.11,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.11,0:07:46.22,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,How long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.70,0:07:47.84,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,Hey, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.84,0:07:49.11,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.35,0:07:52.95,Top,Ark,0,0,0,,Without you, the clan master \Nand leader of Grieving Souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:54.73,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,we can't get anything started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:58.33,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Clan master?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:02.59,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,The leader... of the Grievers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:07.71,Top Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,We are now in the golden age \Nof the treasure hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.71,0:08:11.16,Top Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Amid the sparkling talent on \Ndisplay in the capital of Zebrudia,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:14.28,Top Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,there was one man who stood \Nout amongst all others!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:16.97,Top Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,His name is Krai Andrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:20.01,Top Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,This is an epic tale \Nfull of glory and agony
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.01,0:08:22.12,Top Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,of how he became renowned \Nfor being the leader
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:25.10,Top Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,of the strongest party he founded\Nwith his childhood friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:28.52,Top Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,and also the master of the strongest clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:32.15,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs15\pos(483.079,205.905)}"Thousand Tricks"\N{\u1\fs20}Krai Andrey{\fs15\u0}\NHunter level 8
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:31.91,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to puke...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:02.17,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,First Steps... Like the first footstep, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:04.27,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,That's why they're known as Steps for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.27,0:09:05.47,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:07.93,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"Today, I Just Want to Go Home"...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:08.48,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 01
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:08.48,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}Today, I Just Want to Go Home
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:26.92,Show Title,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,700)\pos(324,269)\fscx95\fscy76}Let This Grieving Soul Retire
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:39.76,Internal,Krai,0,0,0,,It happened several years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:42.19,Internal,Krai,0,0,0,,We had just come to the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.19,0:09:46.97,Internal,Krai,0,0,0,,but we were finishing treasure vaults \Nsuited for beginners in record speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.97,0:09:49.48,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,Krai! Don't move a step!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.47,0:09:49.48,Flashback Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:56.23,Flashback,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.23,0:09:58.21,Flashback,Liz,0,0,0,,This is the last one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:10:00.26,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.73,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,That's our Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.73,0:10:02.24,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:04.88,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,You were playing the bait, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:08.59,Flashback,Krai(M),0,0,0,,{\i1}I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.59,0:10:12.65,Flashback Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Hey, next you need to \Nwatch me defeat one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:15.04,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,We all shared the same dream \Nof becoming treasure hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.41,0:10:15.64,Flashback Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:17.55,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,But the amount of talent \Nwe had was not equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:16.73,Flashback Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:18.26,Flashback Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Let's hurry, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:22.28,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Compared to the monstrous potential \Nthe other five possessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:24.93,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I was exceedingly ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.93,0:10:28.26,Flashback Top,Luke,0,0,0,,See! Let's rush through this to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:28.26,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,If I had stayed with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.26,0:10:29.79,Flashback Top,Luke,0,0,0,,We're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.26,0:10:30.53,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,sooner or later,\N I'd only be getting in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:31.27,Flashback Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.48,0:10:33.27,Flashback Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:34.44,Flashback Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:36.11,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Though they'd be kind\Nenough not to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.89,0:10:37.78,Flashback Top,Luke,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Krai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:42.64,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Which is why I had to make \Nthat decision for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.57,0:10:47.05,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,To leave this party.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.89,0:10:50.10,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.93,0:10:54.41,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,I know all of you will go on \Nto become incredible hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.41,0:10:57.40,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,So I hope you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:10:58.80,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,Look, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:10:59.42,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:02.63,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about this for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.63,0:11:04.68,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,We don't have a leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:06.94,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,What? Yeah, I guess that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:09.12,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,You should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:10.05,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,Be our leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.05,0:11:11.07,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.07,0:11:12.70,Flashback,Liz,0,0,0,,That's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:13.51,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.51,0:11:15.71,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,You're good at giving speeches, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:16.55,Flashback,Ansem,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:18.80,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Wait, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:21.54,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,were you even listening to what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:24.84,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That's how everything began, \Nand also how it ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.47,0:11:27.13,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,For years now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:33.04,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I've been the leader of this party \Nof my gifted childhood friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.82,0:11:38.00,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Always wishing that I could \Nretire from being a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:42.05,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,I still can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:46.58,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Krai is the clan master of First Steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:48.32,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,But you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.09,0:11:54.30,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,being late because you overslept \Nis a joke only you'd make.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.45,0:11:58.26,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Stay away from my master, fake pretty boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:00.50,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Your superficiality is contagious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:02.12,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,Superficiality?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:07.13,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,Tino, you're too funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:14.51,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,I guess you were observing the crowd by \Ngoing incognito among the common folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:16.11,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:18.71,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,Ah, that's why you're\Nnot wearing your uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:21.06,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,After you ordered us all \Nto be properly dressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.06,0:12:23.28,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Like I said, I just overslept.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:25.59,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I didn't have time to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:27.20,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:29.87,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Ark here isn't the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.87,0:12:33.01,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Hunters basically never \Nlisten to anything you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:37.93,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master, this guy is really too insulting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.93,0:12:39.77,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Let us strike his name from the clan roster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.77,0:12:40.64,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:44.97,Top,Ark,0,0,0,,Like I said, Tino. You're really too funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:45.82,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Her name is Tino Shade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.97,0:12:45.88,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:51.00,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(524,481)\bord2\u1\pos(151.889,242.889)}Tino Shade\N{\fs15\u0}Hunter level 4
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:46.78,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Level 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:48.07,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Fake pretty boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.43,0:12:50.13,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,A solo hunter affiliated with Steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:50.66,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Stop laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:55.36,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,And she's also an apprentice \Nto my childhood friend, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.41,0:12:58.27,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,So how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.27,0:13:00.48,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,Did you find a good candidate?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:03.37,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well, we have enough members right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:04.16,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.39,0:13:09.27,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If I said I had a potential\Nnew member in mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:11.30,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,would you take them in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.30,0:13:14.05,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,I would. I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.05,0:13:16.05,Default,All,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:17.62,Default,Isabella,0,0,0,,Slow down, Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.62,0:13:18.82,Default,Isabella,0,0,0,,This is out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:20.86,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,Only one person, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:26.49,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Anyone at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.49,0:13:28.08,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,As long as you recommend them, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.40,0:13:30.07,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That's Ark for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.57,0:13:32.83,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Not only is he handsome, he's also generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.83,0:13:34.30,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.99,0:13:38.71,Default,Isabella,0,0,0,,Forcing them onto us...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.39,0:13:42.03,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:45.69,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Being chosen is such an honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.69,0:13:50.22,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,but I've already set my \Nheart on joining you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:53.34,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,So joining that fake boy's party's a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.34,0:13:54.94,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:55.98,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.37,0:13:57.71,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Not him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:13:59.48,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Tino, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:03.24,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Uf you sho deshperatey wan me an beg,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:05.95,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,I guesh I could shink about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.95,0:14:07.52,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Shut up, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.84,0:14:09.19,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.72,0:14:11.87,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You said you were a level 4, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:14.36,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But you're not affiliated with any party?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:16.70,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,It's none of your damn business!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.70,0:14:18.20,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:19.61,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:23.88,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\bord2\u1\pos(164.889,242.889)}Gilbert Bush\N{\fs15\u0}Hunter level 4
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.90,0:14:21.57,Top,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Gilbert Bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:23.87,Top,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Gilbert of the Purgatorial Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:26.17,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Purgatorial Sword, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:28.87,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,He won't be an asset immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.87,0:14:31.21,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but once Ark and the others train him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:32.88,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:35.68,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I am terrible at judging people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:38.77,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Anyone I pick will be based on luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:42.51,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Fine then, Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.51,0:14:44.67,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I shall recommend you to Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:46.98,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,On one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.98,0:14:48.30,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Which is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:51.52,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What do you think is the most \Nimportant thing for a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:56.67,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's to not lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:58.59,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If you lack strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:00.84,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,you will eventually put \Nyour party into danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.84,0:15:04.13,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So I need you to show me \Nyour ability to not lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.73,0:15:09.42,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,By the way... since becoming a hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:11.18,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I haven't lost a single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:12.68,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:14.33,Top,All,0,0,0,,Wow! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:15.22,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,You're so amazing, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:15.22,Top,All,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:19.61,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Well, I simply have never \Nbeen in a proper fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:25.22,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,This is to every single one \Nof you here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:30.06,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I will recommend whoever manages \Nto get this relic to Ark Brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.96,0:15:59.13,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:01.64,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Where is Master's ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.47,0:16:03.99,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.85,0:16:09.18,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:13.63,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,By the way, that ring is actually a relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.63,0:16:17.25,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Whoever gets it can keep it, so good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:20.53,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Rhuda and The Great Greg.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:21.24,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:23.61,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Maybe we'll see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.61,0:16:25.55,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.55,0:16:27.00,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Later, Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:28.46,Default,Ark,0,0,0,,Yes. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:34.03,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,You're in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:37.16,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.55,0:16:43.00,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.29,0:16:48.69,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Krai, you made the front page news.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:48.69,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(523,1)\bord2\fs15\pos(508,100)}First Steps Clan House
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.69,0:16:55.50,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,"Huge Brawl Breaks Out at \NArk Brave's Recruitment."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.50,0:16:57.97,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,It ended with the venue getting blown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:01.20,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Were any civilians hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.20,0:17:03.69,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Luckily, there seem to \Nhave been no injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:06.71,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(529,560)\bord2\fs15\u1\pos(477.889,19.889)}First Steps Vice Clan Master\N{\fs20\u0\pos(164.889,242.889)}Eva Renfied
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.69,0:17:06.21,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,But the Explorers' \NAssociation wants a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:07.22,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.55,0:17:09.49,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Did Ark say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.49,0:17:11.81,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,He read the article and laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.81,0:17:14.45,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,He really is easy-going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:19.09,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Great, then put the pub's repair \Nbill onto Ark's account.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.09,0:17:21.61,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,And please have him go to the \NExplorers' Association as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:26.72,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,You really do rely on Ark too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:30.36,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,The Explorers' Association specifically \Nasked for you to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.86,0:17:33.39,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Knowing Branch Manager Gark,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.39,0:17:36.09,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,if I don't go, he'll come to see me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:39.81,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I don't want to go outside \Nwithout an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.36,0:17:43.54,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,My disguise relic was broken, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:45.49,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,The Reversible Face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:47.29,Internal,Voice,0,0,0,,Reversible Face!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:49.32,Internal,Voice,0,0,0,,Equip! And activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:51.75,Internal,Voice,0,0,0,,Just like that, a visual change!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.75,0:17:53.25,Internal,Voice,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.25,0:17:56.03,Internal,Voice,0,0,0,,You can have any face you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.03,0:17:57.76,Internal,Voice,0,0,0,,It's a real revolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.63,0:17:59.43,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(571,1)\bord2}Reversible Face
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:59.43,Internal,Voice,0,0,0,,Reversible Face!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:01.92,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Don't leave home without it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.85,0:18:04.18,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(521,1)\bord2\fs15\pos(381,301)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}*Please make sure to consult the user guide and use responsibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.18,0:18:07.23,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,No one's going to attack you at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.23,0:18:10.18,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's never happened to you, \Nso it's easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:12.44,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I guess I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.39,0:18:14.58,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.97,0:18:17.02,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I am so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:19.95,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,{\i1}So{\i0} sorry for all the trouble I caused!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.95,0:18:21.39,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It wasn't on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.39,0:18:22.46,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It wasn't out of malice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.46,0:18:24.95,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,And I made sure that no \Ncivilians would get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:27.25,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Honestly, I was in a bind myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:29.20,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Not like I could have stopped that chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:31.72,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Once it started, the only \Nway was to let it play out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:34.58,Top,Gark,0,0,0,,Hey, stop trying to rush through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:37.97,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(526,479)\bord2\fs12\u1\pos(475.222,248.334)}Explorers' Association Zebrudia Branch Manager\N{\u0\fs20}Gark Welter
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:37.00,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,The only damage was to the building, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:37.70,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,So it's okay, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.70,0:18:39.52,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Better property than people!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.52,0:18:40.90,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Nobody has sent in a complaint yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:42.80,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,the owner of that pub \Nhall and I go way back,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:43.92,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,and they're a super nice person,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:46.26,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,so it's fine! They'll forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.26,0:18:48.50,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,And I want ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.09,0:18:51.30,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,Krai, please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.30,0:18:54.11,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,Also, you don't have to scold him that hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.11,0:18:57.23,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,I haven't even scolded him \Nat all yet, but whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:00.74,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,Take this, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:03.04,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Even if nobody has officially complained,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.04,0:19:08.61,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,a clan like First Steps needs to \Nset an example for other hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.61,0:19:11.00,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,If you get off scot free, it'll be no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:12.90,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You mean a chore?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:14.00,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Don't call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:17.39,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,The Explorers' Association,\Nthe Association for short,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:20.01,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,gets all sorts of jobs for hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.01,0:19:21.23,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Some of those jobs
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.23,0:19:22.53,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,pay so little,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.53,0:19:23.68,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,have such short deadlines,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:25.97,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,or are so stupidly difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:28.17,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,that nobody will do them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.17,0:19:32.92,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Hunters respectfully call these \Ntypes of jobs "chores."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:38.81,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,This puts me in quite a predicament!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.81,0:19:41.60,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,As an ex-hunter yourself, \Nsurely you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:42.20,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.53,0:19:46.44,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not saying that \NI won't accept this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:49.37,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You've done so much for me, so I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.37,0:19:50.55,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But if I may say one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:54.56,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Our misstep this time \Nwasn't even {\i1}that{\i0} bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:56.90,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,I feel like his provoke \Nskill leveled up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:57.54,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.97,0:19:59.09,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:20:00.14,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:04.42,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'll try to pick an easy \None and pass it on to Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.42,0:20:10.39,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Treasure vault levels of 5, 4, 5, 7, 6...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.39,0:20:12.05,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Found one! A level 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.05,0:20:13.62,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'll take this one, Gark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.18,0:20:15.96,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Put me on corpse retrieval duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.53,0:20:19.05,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,That's a rescue mission, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.05,0:20:20.97,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,You shouldn't make light of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.13,0:20:24.94,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,He really is always full of energy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:28.58,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,He's fine just as he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:30.97,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Nothing's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.22,0:20:32.45,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:36.63,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,He went ahead and chose the most \Ndangerous looking mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:39.95,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What? Ark's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.95,0:20:41.04,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:44.86,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,The fake pretty boy was summoned \Nby some nobles or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:46.60,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,He said he'd be gone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.60,0:20:47.71,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:49.98,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So nobody's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.65,0:20:52.22,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.22,0:20:53.20,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:54.73,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.73,0:20:56.37,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You got the ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.37,0:20:57.35,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:21:01.86,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I didn't want anyone else\Nto get their hands on your ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:04.35,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Can I really keep this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.35,0:21:05.31,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:07.61,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's just a Shooting Ring, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:09.41,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.41,0:21:12.11,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So hey, are you free right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:14.67,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.67,0:21:17.12,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I've never been more free in my entire life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.12,0:21:19.82,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Which is why I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.14,0:21:20.38,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.38,0:21:22.35,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I got a quest from the \NExplorers' Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:29.38,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.15,0:21:41.15,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs30\shad2\4c&H000000&\fnImpact\b0}Hounding Chain
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:43.70,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,All yours, Silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.15,0:21:47.66,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.08,0:21:52.15,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,This is the biggest shock of my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.15,0:21:54.49,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,My maidenly heart is in tatters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.49,0:21:57.73,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I never would have imagined you'd \Ndo something this terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.73,0:21:59.03,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I've been deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.03,0:22:00.47,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,A bait-and-switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.47,0:22:01.83,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I never deceived you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.83,0:22:03.67,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,nor did I pull a bait-and-switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:05.93,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,In all honesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.38,0:22:10.54,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,all I wanted to do was go \Nhave some ice cream with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:16.45,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Instead, you're making me do this \Nunprecedented crappy chore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.64,0:22:20.13,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,The compensation is minimal,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.13,0:22:21.93,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,the contractual binding time is super long...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.59,0:22:26.44,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I can't find a single good thing about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:30.07,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Who the hell would ever take this on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.07,0:22:31.06,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:32.16,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You're so right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:36.18,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master, I'm still a level 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.18,0:22:38.83,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,There's no way I can rescue \Nfive people all alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.09,0:22:40.06,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:40.83,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You're so right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.25,0:22:43.84,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I know you send us on these missions
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.84,0:22:48.33,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,where we brush with death as a \Nway to make us all stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:51.09,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,but please don't get carried \Naway with the Spartan training!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.09,0:22:52.15,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.15,0:22:54.04,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You're so righ...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.04,0:22:55.35,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Close to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.27,0:22:57.92,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,On a level 3?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.25,0:23:00.56,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.91,0:23:03.21,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You're saying you don't \Nwant to go all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.86,0:23:05.12,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.12,0:23:09.71,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,But you know, if you came \Nalong, that would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:10.24,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,This is at the White Wolf's Den, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.24,0:23:10.99,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.39,0:23:16.82,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,A girl shouldered with misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:21.27,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Will this impromptu party of four be \Nable to face this mystery job
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.27,0:23:23.44,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,that everybody shied away from?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.37,0:23:25.61,Top Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Find out in the next episode!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.61,0:23:26.93,Top Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Don't miss it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:44.90,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(471,355)}By: Tino Shade & Wall Spaghetti Party
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.90,0:23:32.23,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,My master, also known as Thousand\NTricks, forced this on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.23,0:23:33.04,Top,all,0,0,0,,Urgent request!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:35.29,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,We have to go to the White \NWolf's. Danger is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.29,0:23:36.11,Top,all,0,0,0,,Treasure vault!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.11,0:23:36.90,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Hastily assembled!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.90,0:23:37.69,Top,all,0,0,0,,Wall spaghetti party!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.69,0:23:38.44,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,We'll go all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.44,0:23:39.12,Top,all,0,0,0,,Until the end?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.12,0:23:40.96,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Is everybody ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.96,0:23:42.15,Top,All,0,0,0,,Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.15,0:23:44.05,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Next time on {\i1}Let This Grieving Soul{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.05,0:23:45.21,Top,All,0,0,0,,...{\i1}Retire!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.90,0:23:49.89,EpTitle,title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 02
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.90,0:23:49.89,EpTitle,title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}I Want to Leave It to Tino and Take It Easy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.21,0:23:46.41,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,You're on, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.89,0:23:48.99,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"I Want to Leave It to Tino and Take It Easy."
